---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Councils and Districts
eyebrow: Districts 94–99
intro: Explore the 24 councils currently assigned to the Southern California Chapter.
permalink: /councils/
---
{% block head %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIINfQ3ynhHdqZtAI4lv7cV9bXmCe1OBY=" crossorigin="">{% endblock %}
<p>Use the district filters to focus the map and directory. Map markers show the approximate city or ZIP location published by the official council finder, not a verified meeting address.</p>
<div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter councils by district"><button class="filter" data-district-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All districts</button>{% for district in [94,95,96,97,98,99] %}<button class="filter" data-district-filter="{{ district }}" aria-pressed="false">District {{ district }}</button>{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="map-layout">
  <div class="map-wrap"><div id="council-map" class="map" aria-label="Approximate map of Southern California Chapter councils"></div><p class="map-note">Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors. Council names, cities, and ZIP codes were checked against the official Knights of Columbus council finder.</p></div>
  <div class="council-list" aria-live="polite">{% for council in councils %}<article class="council-card" data-council-card data-district="{{ council.district }}"><p>District {{ council.district }}</p><h2>Council {{ council.councilNumber }}</h2><strong>{{ council.name }}</strong><p>{{ council.city }}, California</p><a href="{{ council.mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Navigate with Google Maps →</a></article>{% endfor %}</div>
</div>
<script id="council-data" type="application/json">{{ councils | dump | safe }}</script>
{% block scripts %}<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/assets/js/councils-map.js"></script>{% endblock %}
